# The statement vocabulary (tithe pass 2, A6), read from the grammar by sir/build/Roles.java: each
# verb, then `roles` its operands can carry and `branches` the labels of its nested statements.
# Phase 3's lowering covers every line. Written by `gradle test -Dkatana.record=true`.
ACCEPT
  roles accept-from-date-statement accept-from-escape-key-statement accept-from-mnemonic-statement accept-message-count-statement accept-statement
  branches not-on-exception-clause on-exception-clause
ADD
  roles add-corresponding-statement add-from add-giving add-statement add-to add-to-giving add-to-giving-statement add-to-statement
  branches not-on-size-error-phrase on-size-error-phrase
ALTER
  roles alter-proceed-to alter-statement
CALL
  roles call-by-content call-by-content-phrase call-by-reference call-by-reference-phrase call-by-value call-by-value-phrase call-giving-phrase call-statement call-using-phrase
  branches not-on-exception-clause on-exception-clause on-overflow-phrase
CANCEL
  roles cancel-call cancel-statement cobol-word
CLOSE
